<title>UK: London gold fixes fraction weaker at $319.50.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes fraction weaker at $319.50.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $319.50 down $0.25. Recovered through New York close on physical buying, short covering. Nervous but potential for attempt on $322.50.</p>
<p>SILVER - Barely changed at $4.31/$4.33. May retry $4.40 resistance if gold turns firmer.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up around $2.50 at $405.50/$408.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - About $4.50 firmer at $176.00/$180.00.</p>
</text>
